{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (instead of imagenet_vit_l) with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6776 (F1: 0.6464). The result suggests the image encoder choice may impact performance, as it underperforms the previous best configuration (config_039) using imagenet_vit_l. However, the exact contribution of the image encoder versus other factors remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence."
}

